  "bio": "Gorki is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Antalya, Turkey, specializing in black & gray and realism styles that bring artwork to life on the skin. Clients appreciate not only Gorki's exceptional talent but also the immaculate cleanliness maintained in the studio, ensuring a safe and sterile environment for each tattoo session. Gorki's professionalism is evident in every aspect of their work, from the first sketch to the final touch of the tattoo needle.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Antalya, Antalya, Turkey"
